    "title": "Vehicles, bicycles, electric bicycles, electric scooters and pedestrians (7)(a)",
    "text": "The operator of a bicycle, an electric bicycle or an electric scooter shall not: Intentionally interfere with the movement of a motor vehicle.",
    "source": "NRS 484B.270(7)(a)"
